    "one_liner": "An analysis of the top 20 trending GitHub repositories in the past 24 hours reveals overwhelming dominance of AI coding agent tools, Claude Code skill extensions, and developer productivity utilities.",
    "goal": "The audience should understand which categories of AI-related open-source projects are surging in popularity, identify the key repos and patterns driving the trend, and assess strategic implications for developer tooling investment."
  },
  "slides": [
    {
      "id": "title-slide",
      "title": "GitHub Trending Repos Snapshot: The Rise of AI Coding Agents & Claude Code Skills",
      "objective": "Cover slide with deck title, subtitle referencing OSSInsight's 10.6B+ GitHub events dataset, and date context. Clean, visually striking layout."
    },
    {
      "id": "platform-overview",
      "title": "OSSInsight Tracks 10.6 Billion GitHub Events in Real Time",
      "objective": "Introduce OSSInsight as the data source, highlighting its scale (10.6B events, stars/PRs/issues/commits/reviews). Use a few key stats as callout numbers to establish credibility."
